@startuml
[*] --> Unassigned : Initial State
Unassigned --> Assigned to client : Assignment to a client
Unassigned --> Added to campaign : Addition to a campaign
Assigned to client --> Unassigned : Removal from assignment
Added to campaign --> Unassigned : Removal from assignment
Assigned to client --> Unemployed : Staff member leaves the job
Added to campaign --> Unemployed : Staff member leaves the job
Unemployed --> Archived : Time passes (archive record)
Archived --> [*] : Final State

@enduml
